Package: solocast
Version: @VERSION@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libstdc++6 (>= 5.2), libgcc-s1 | libgcc1, ca-certificates
Recommends: xdg-utils
Maintainer: kerstz <167791613+kerstz@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/kerstz/solocast
Description: one-person live streaming site (studio, viewer page, chat)
 SoloCast lets a single streamer go live from the browser; viewers watch
 and chat. It starts a local server, opens the studio and can publish a
 shareable public address through a Cloudflare quick tunnel.
 .
 Node.js, the LiveKit media server and cloudflared are bundled under
 /opt/solocast: nothing else needs to be installed.
